v 3
d 'RDISTNN': CATE and nonparametric regression with DNN weights
d Version: 0.1.0
d Distribution-Date: 20261014
d
d Initial public-release focus: conditional average treatment effects and
d nonparametric regression with distributional nearest-neighbor weights,
d pointwise jackknife uncertainty, tuning grids, diagnostics, and native plots.
d Supplied nuisances remain external; valid inference requires the documented
d nuisance, localization, stability, and bias conditions.
d
d plqr_dnn is experimental: it evaluates localized score moments at a
d supplied theta vector and does not perform local root solving or coefficient
d inference.
d
d Companion to the R package RdistNN and the conditional Z-estimation paper;
d current working-paper citation metadata is maintained in RdistNN.
d
d Author: Jakob Juergens
d License: GNU GPL version 3 or later (GPL-3.0-or-later)
d Native plugin: additional Stata-linking permission in rdistnn_linking_exception.md
d
